+def _fence_outside_text_lines(text):
+    """`text` 按行产出 fenced code block 之外的行（str 版）。复用单一源 `FenceTracker`
+    （与 `_line_scoped_hits`/`_normalize_checkbox_lines`/`_parse_plan` 同口径——``` 与 ~~~
